  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing critical shelter and protection needs in Palestine.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ongoing conflict, compounded by repeated displacement and relocation orders, has significantly intensified shelter needs across Gaza. As a result, the majority of displaced individuals are forced into inadequate living conditions, including overcrowded collective centres, or damaged and unfinished buildings, self-settled urban sites, and deteriorating tents or makeshift shelters that offer minimal weather protection, privacy, or dignity. To address these severe conditions and improve the safety, dignity, and protection of internally displaced persons (IDPs), Shelter and non-food items (NFIs) will be distributed to affected families.</narrative>
  </description>
